// CaptureLocal (compute node): local snapshot of a set of attachments of
// one allocation. Suspends all overlays (drains in-flight I/O),
// create_snap of each, resumes all, activates the snapshots read-only. If
// the suspended window exceeds 2s everything is resumed, the partial
// snapshots are deleted and the result is FAILED with
// ERROR_CODE_SUSPEND_TIMEOUT. Guest CPUs are never paused. Works with the
